description: Keep project documentation written in English
alwaysApply: true
---

# Project Documentation Language

- Write repository documentation in English.
- This applies to Markdown files, documentation under `documents/`, the root
  `README.md`, changelog entries, and developer-facing configuration notes.
- Keep documentation examples, headings, tables, comments in documentation,
  and explanatory text in English.
- Do not translate existing documentation into another language unless the
  file is explicitly a localized variant.
- User prompts may be written in any language; repository-facing documentation
  must still follow this English-only policy.
